# AssemblyInfo.cs is generated from AssemblyInfo.cs.in by this directory's
# Makefile and must not be tracked (#9678).  .out1 and .out2 are the scratch
# files that rule writes on the way.  AssemblyInfo.cs.in and the hand
# written .cs sources stay tracked
/AssemblyInfo.cs
/AssemblyInfo.cs.out1
/AssemblyInfo.cs.out2

# outputs of the signing path in Makefile (commented out for now) and the
# mono debug symbols.  SQLRClient.dll itself is covered by *.dll in
# src/.gitignore, and SQLRClient.dll.config is hand written and stays
# tracked - *.dll does not match it
*.snk
*.il
*.dll.in
*.mdb
